"You know," Arraka purrs, "teleportation is my specialty. Crack this clasp and I'll pluck a few ogres straight from their beds. We can have a lovely little warm-up right here. What do you say?"

Hadrik grins, tapping the gold casing. "Not today, old woman."

"Pity. Would've been entertaining."

