"The sword's purification enchantment can be focused manually," Daren insists, blade angled low. "If I concentrate, I can sever the spirit without harming the vessel."

"Have you lost your mind?" I shout. "If the weapon can't lock onto her aura on its own, you're guessing in the dark! You'll butcher them both!"

